(4038204, 576825, 70298, '<td valign="top">Great action shot! To improve it would hav been better if the ball ahd been closer, so that the photo could have been cropped in a bit.Not your fault though, because it would have meant the runner would be too close to the base and blocking the catcher. I don''t know.. :-)</td>', 'Great action shot! To improve it would hav been better if the ball ahd been closer, so that the photo could have been cropped in a bit.Not your fault though, because it would have meant the runner would be too close to the base and blocking the catcher. I don''t know.. :-)', '2007-08-29 11:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
