(4039470, 578395, 77195, '<td valign="top">lol. great idea. i wonder if a different angle would increase the impact of this shot, maybe lower to the ground?</td>', 'lol. great idea. i wonder if a different angle would increase the impact of this shot, maybe lower to the ground?', '2007-08-29 18:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039481, 575696, 77195, '<td valign="top">if you could darken the rest of image except the snail, i think that would improve this significantly. none the less, what a great capture. now you just have to take a pic of a train, and then stick it in. now that would be an amazing amazing picture. right new idea for my next pic now :) well done</td>', 'if you could darken the rest of image except the snail, i think that would improve this significantly. none the less, what a great capture. now you just have to take a pic of a train, and then stick it in. now that would be an amazing amazing picture. right new idea for my next pic now :) well done', '2007-08-29 18:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039490, 578098, 77195, '<td valign="top">bottom left shoudl be removed as its a bit distracting (i know its outside the rule of this challenge), but im just saying so that you can increase the impace of this great great picture. love the tone, the reflection in the rear mirror. dont think the blue streak goes well with the green tone of the foreground. vut very nicely done indeed. Ha, i even noticed the foot on the pedal. great shot.</td>', 'bottom left shoudl be removed as its a bit distracting (i know its outside the rule of this challenge), but im just saying so that you can increase the impace of this great great picture. love the tone, the reflection in the rear mirror. dont think the blue streak goes well with the green tone of the foreground. vut very nicely done indeed. Ha, i even noticed the foot on the pedal. great shot.', '2007-08-29 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
