(4039511, 577714, 81664, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture! I suppose you could say YOU were speedy as well to be able to get the shot. They move so quickly!</td>', 'Beautiful capture! I suppose you could say YOU were speedy as well to be able to get the shot. They move so quickly!', '2007-08-29 18:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039512, 578172, 81664, '<td valign="top">OOh cool legs!</td>', 'OOh cool legs!', '2007-08-29 18:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039548, 578670, 32334, '<td valign="top">I love the clouds in the background and the way that the bird appears to kinda be breaking out of the clouds.  However I think this bird could be a lot brighter and it would help the image tremendously.  Don''t know how you''d do that except with a monster flash or something.</td>', 'I love the clouds in the background and the way that the bird appears to kinda be breaking out of the clouds.  However I think this bird could be a lot brighter and it would help the image tremendously.  Don''t know how you''d do that except with a monster flash or something.', '2007-08-29 19:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039551, 577471, 32334, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photo, the crispness of the biker is great, but I think the orange cones and the dude in blue on the left is kinda distracting.</td>', 'Not a bad photo, the crispness of the biker is great, but I think the orange cones and the dude in blue on the left is kinda distracting.', '2007-08-29 19:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039553, 577574, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good image.  Unfortunate grammatical error in title.  Not reducing my vote because of it, mind you.  Just a distraction from an otherwise fine entry.  (You meant.... they''re) (8)</td>', 'Good image.  Unfortunate grammatical error in title.  Not reducing my vote because of it, mind you.  Just a distraction from an otherwise fine entry.  (You meant.... they''re) (8)', '2007-08-29 19:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
