(4041285, 578572, 68586, '<td valign="top">I really like the colours in this - but personally I think it fits into abstract rather than speed. I know that speed was used to create the picture - but I would want to see what was speeding or some sort of visual context to better understand the shot.<br/> <br/>As I say - still a nice shot though.</td>', 'I really like the colours in this - but personally I think it fits into abstract rather than speed. I know that speed was used to create the picture - but I would want to see what was speeding or some sort of visual context to better understand the shot. As I say - still a nice shot though.', '2007-08-30 10:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
