(4041292, 577988, 68586, '<td valign="top">I love the tail held high. <br/> <br/>What would have really set this picture off perfectly for me would be if you had some background blur to emphasise the movement. This would leave only this rather magnificent horse in focus and lose the fence, trees etc.</td>', 'I love the tail held high.  What would have really set this picture off perfectly for me would be if you had some background blur to emphasise the movement. This would leave only this rather magnificent horse in focus and lose the fence, trees etc.', '2007-08-30 10:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
