(4041861, 577286, 68586, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it''s me . .  but I''m really not sure what this is meant to be saying about speed ? I shall try to look it up post challenge and see the explanation. Good luck.</td>', 'I''m sure it''s me . .  but I''m really not sure what this is meant to be saying about speed ? I shall try to look it up post challenge and see the explanation. Good luck.', '2007-08-30 15:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
