(4041865, 577995, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice action shot. Ideally you would have had a shallower DoF to lose the cars in the background.</td>', 'nice action shot. Ideally you would have had a shallower DoF to lose the cars in the background.', '2007-08-30 15:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041873, 578563, 30049, '<td valign="top">Quite an assortment you have there.  :)  As a photo it''s a bit static and kind of cluttered.  The right side of this wanders off to the top right with a slight curve.  This throws off any sense of order.  The assortment would be better displayed in a photo also by aligning the focal plane of your camera with the items (you''re coming in at an angle).  A bit more light to make it bright and shiny would also help, along with more contrast.  All JMO of course.  :P  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Quite an assortment you have there.  :)  As a photo it''s a bit static and kind of cluttered.  The right side of this wanders off to the top right with a slight curve.  This throws off any sense of order.  The assortment would be better displayed in a photo also by aligning the focal plane of your camera with the items (you''re coming in at an angle).  A bit more light to make it bright and shiny would also help, along with more contrast.  All JMO of course.  :P  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-30 15:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041881, 577648, 30049, '<td valign="top">A slightly longer exposure time (not too much) would help this with the speed impact (light trails). To really make this work the background lights of the buildings and the overhead road sign should be crisp, not blurry.  JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A slightly longer exposure time (not too much) would help this with the speed impact (light trails). To really make this work the background lights of the buildings and the overhead road sign should be crisp, not blurry.  JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-30 15:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041885, 576825, 68586, '<td valign="top">This has grown on me from when I first viewed it. <br/> <br/>While it''s obviously nice to have captured the ball in the shot, what really works for me is the diagonal it forms between the ball entering top left, and the catcher waiting for it bottom right. The shot is perfectly cropped to keep both players in the frame forming another lower diagonal running bottom left to mid right, and the triangle of grass shows that there is more outside of this picture than just brown dirt.<br/> <br/>The figures are crisp and clear, and have a natural tension between the one running and frozen in time, and the other frozen waiting for the ball to make it''s way down the picture.<br/> <br/>Or at least that''s how I see it  :-  )<br/> <br/>Good shot.</td>', 'This has grown on me from when I first viewed it.  While it''s obviously nice to have captured the ball in the shot, what really works for me is the diagonal it forms between the ball entering top left, and the catcher waiting for it bottom right. The shot is perfectly cropped to keep both players in the frame forming another lower diagonal running bottom left to mid right, and the triangle of grass shows that there is more outside of this picture than just brown dirt. The figures are crisp and clear, and have a natural tension between the one running and frozen in time, and the other frozen waiting for the ball to make it''s way down the picture. Or at least that''s how I see it  :-  ) Good shot.', '2007-08-30 15:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041892, 578592, 68586, '<td valign="top">A nice clear shot with converging lines leading the viewers eye into the picture, but I think personally I would like to have actually seen some sort of reason for being drawn into the picture - a clear focal point.<br/> <br/>Nothing wrong with the shot though, and it clearly meets the challenge.</td>', 'A nice clear shot with converging lines leading the viewers eye into the picture, but I think personally I would like to have actually seen some sort of reason for being drawn into the picture - a clear focal point. Nothing wrong with the shot though, and it clearly meets the challenge.', '2007-08-30 15:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041893, 578259, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a cute photo (I think).  Hard to tell much about the dog.  Does he/she have any "clothes" on at all?  Too far away to tell for sure.  Is there a connection between the dog and the red object on the sand, or is that an incidental item?<br/> <br/>Compositionally you''ve followed some good rules with using ROT on the beach and water line, and the red object in the lower left.<br/> <br/>Would I think ''Speed'' just looking at this photo without a title?  Maybe.  With the title it''s even more confusing what the storyline of this photo is.<br/> <br/>Sorry if I''m missing something obvious.  Will be returning after the challenge to see if some of the questions are answered, and to see what others had to say about this as will.  Should be a good read.  :P<br/> <br/>At any rate, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a cute photo (I think).  Hard to tell much about the dog.  Does he/she have any "clothes" on at all?  Too far away to tell for sure.  Is there a connection between the dog and the red object on the sand, or is that an incidental item? Compositionally you''ve followed some good rules with using ROT on the beach and water line, and the red object in the lower left. Would I think ''Speed'' just looking at this photo without a title?  Maybe.  With the title it''s even more confusing what the storyline of this photo is. Sorry if I''m missing something obvious.  Will be returning after the challenge to see if some of the questions are answered, and to see what others had to say about this as will.  Should be a good read.  :P At any rate, good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-30 15:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041901, 576578, 30049, '<td valign="top">Dang.  This photo is so busy with all of the color and bright lights, the blurred lines of the car lights are nearly lost.  Cool starbursts on the larger lights.  :)<br/> <br/>I know <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=23394" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Skip</a> is a fine photographer here at DPC, but I didn''t know he owned a market.  :P<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Dang.  This photo is so busy with all of the color and bright lights, the blurred lines of the car lights are nearly lost.  Cool starbursts on the larger lights.  :) I know  Skip is a fine photographer here at DPC, but I didn''t know he owned a market.  :P Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-30 15:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041910, 578345, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool car.  Seems to be going a bit slow - coming into pit row perhaps?  A slower shutter speed may have given you a bit more motion blur.  As it is, the guys in the background give the impression that the cars barely moving.<br/> <br/>Could be my monitor...did you check the histogram on this shot?  Seems a little underexposed.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cool car.  Seems to be going a bit slow - coming into pit row perhaps?  A slower shutter speed may have given you a bit more motion blur.  As it is, the guys in the background give the impression that the cars barely moving. Could be my monitor...did you check the histogram on this shot?  Seems a little underexposed. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-30 15:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041911, 578098, 68586, '<td valign="top">very stylised shot. There are a number of elements in this that I really like and think they work well together to give the shot some real punch.<br/> <br/>Such as the vignette in the mirror of the drivers face - not all of his face, just enough - the whole rotated cropto give strong diagonals and the drivers arm in the top left of the picture. <br/> <br/>This is a powerful shot, and I hope people take the time to look at it properly.</td>', 'very stylised shot. There are a number of elements in this that I really like and think they work well together to give the shot some real punch. Such as the vignette in the mirror of the drivers face - not all of his face, just enough - the whole rotated cropto give strong diagonals and the drivers arm in the top left of the picture.  This is a powerful shot, and I hope people take the time to look at it properly.', '2007-08-30 15:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041920, 577847, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yeaaahh!  A fun shot to look at.  :)  Nice capture.  I like the sense of motion that the panned background adds to this.  Would have been a tad stronger IMO if the focal point had been more on the rider than the back tire, but it''s still fine (tricky to do I know).  Overall, very nice.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Yeaaahh!  A fun shot to look at.  :)  Nice capture.  I like the sense of motion that the panned background adds to this.  Would have been a tad stronger IMO if the focal point had been more on the rider than the back tire, but it''s still fine (tricky to do I know).  Overall, very nice.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-08-30 15:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041947, 577841, 68586, '<td valign="top">a really nice abstract, but for me a bit of a stretch to fit the challenge.<br/> <br/>Love the colours though  :-  )</td>', 'a really nice abstract, but for me a bit of a stretch to fit the challenge. Love the colours though  :-  )', '2007-08-30 15:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
