(4041957, 578618, 68586, '<td valign="top">Well I followed your advice - let my mind flow freely, and it flowed out, looked around, peeked behind the sofa, stared out the window and finally came back. However I still have no idea what this is, or symbolises.<br/> <br/>It looks like an interesting abstract - but does it convey speed to me ? Not really. I shall let my mind out for another little wander later and see if that helps at all  :-  )</td>', 'Well I followed your advice - let my mind flow freely, and it flowed out, looked around, peeked behind the sofa, stared out the window and finally came back. However I still have no idea what this is, or symbolises. It looks like an interesting abstract - but does it convey speed to me ? Not really. I shall let my mind out for another little wander later and see if that helps at all  :-  )', '2007-08-30 16:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
