(4043243, 577574, 66515, '<td valign="top">This shot has a bit of potential. You''ve lost a bit off the hind legs of the number 1 horse already. The number 3 horse seems to be the subject in this shot and cropping a bit of the left would add emphasis to that. The number 3 horse actually looks to me like he''s making a move on the outside.<br/> <br/>If this were in advanced I''d work the sky a bit to make it a little darker. <br/> <br/>That aside you got a good capture here with pretty decent sharpness considering the subject(s) are moving.</td>', 'This shot has a bit of potential. You''ve lost a bit off the hind legs of the number 1 horse already. The number 3 horse seems to be the subject in this shot and cropping a bit of the left would add emphasis to that. The number 3 horse actually looks to me like he''s making a move on the outside. If this were in advanced I''d work the sky a bit to make it a little darker.  That aside you got a good capture here with pretty decent sharpness considering the subject(s) are moving.', '2007-08-31 02:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
