(4044072, 576576, 42100, '<td valign="top">Everything is great about this, except that top black area.  It looks awkward and like it doesn''t really belong to this photo.  Minus that, I really like this photo...it''s fun and whimsical!</td>', 'Everything is great about this, except that top black area.  It looks awkward and like it doesn''t really belong to this photo.  Minus that, I really like this photo...it''s fun and whimsical!', '2007-08-31 14:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
