(4044113, 575696, 30049, '<td valign="top">He-he.  You should send a 4x6 print of this with your letter of complaint.  :)  BTW - would make a cool stock photo.  Well done!</td>', 'He-he.  You should send a 4x6 print of this with your letter of complaint.  :)  BTW - would make a cool stock photo.  Well done!', '2007-08-31 14:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044116, 576093, 54431, '<td valign="top">Nice tones. I like the angle that you took this shot from. It feels as though I''m running alongside the dog!</td>', 'Nice tones. I like the angle that you took this shot from. It feels as though I''m running alongside the dog!', '2007-08-31 14:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044121, 576697, 54431, '<td valign="top">I wish the car was in focus to make it stand out from the background.</td>', 'I wish the car was in focus to make it stand out from the background.', '2007-08-31 14:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044124, 578285, 54431, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing the speed of the train!</td>', 'Great job capturing the speed of the train!', '2007-08-31 14:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044187, 578650, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great timing!  I"ve spent hours trying to stop those in mid flight..you done a great job.</td>', 'Great timing!  I"ve spent hours trying to stop those in mid flight..you done a great job.', '2007-08-31 15:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044192, 577909, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic and intriguing!  I love the framing of the airplane.  I would have liked a little detail at the base of the mountain, but it isn''t that bad.</td>', 'Very dramatic and intriguing!  I love the framing of the airplane.  I would have liked a little detail at the base of the mountain, but it isn''t that bad.', '2007-08-31 15:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044194, 577758, 33161, '<td valign="top">This is good, crisp photo that conveys speed(fast). Good use of tripod.</td>', 'This is good, crisp photo that conveys speed(fast). Good use of tripod.', '2007-08-31 15:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044195, 577883, 33161, '<td valign="top">This is cool!</td>', 'This is cool!', '2007-08-31 15:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044196, 577181, 33161, '<td valign="top">too small, but I understand how difficult it is to fit the challenge size requirements</td>', 'too small, but I understand how difficult it is to fit the challenge size requirements', '2007-08-31 15:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044197, 576564, 68256, '<td valign="top">Are you sure you couldn''t have gotten closer?  LOL, just kidding. I''m sure you are getting comments about the sky being blown out so I won''t say it again!<br/> <br/>It is a nice photo, but the standard has been raised so high here at DPC for wildlife photography.  You really have to have WOW to score well with wildlife.  Great capture nonetheless and you should be very proud of it.</td>', 'Are you sure you couldn''t have gotten closer?  LOL, just kidding. I''m sure you are getting comments about the sky being blown out so I won''t say it again! It is a nice photo, but the standard has been raised so high here at DPC for wildlife photography.  You really have to have WOW to score well with wildlife.  Great capture nonetheless and you should be very proud of it.', '2007-08-31 15:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044198, 578293, 33161, '<td valign="top">cool picture</td>', 'cool picture', '2007-08-31 15:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044202, 577574, 68256, '<td valign="top">With all that jumble of horses I don''t get much sense of subject or motion.  I realize this wasn''t a motion challenge, but I''m just saying in general motion would have created more interest.  It is a good capture of speed and energy though.  Did you try motion panning with the horses? Sometimes that will add motion although it can be tricky....</td>', 'With all that jumble of horses I don''t get much sense of subject or motion.  I realize this wasn''t a motion challenge, but I''m just saying in general motion would have created more interest.  It is a good capture of speed and energy though.  Did you try motion panning with the horses? Sometimes that will add motion although it can be tricky....', '2007-08-31 15:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044206, 576904, 68256, '<td valign="top">Awesome example of speed!  I really wanted to capture "the speed of life" for this challenge and never could think of away to do that.  I think you have done so extraordinarily.  The inclusion of the elderly lady is just brilliant.  Thanks for a great shot.  10</td>', 'Awesome example of speed!  I really wanted to capture "the speed of life" for this challenge and never could think of away to do that.  I think you have done so extraordinarily.  The inclusion of the elderly lady is just brilliant.  Thanks for a great shot.  10', '2007-08-31 15:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044214, 578559, 68256, '<td valign="top">I think the centered composition doesn''t do so well here.  With the dog comeing straight to the camera I''m not getting much sense of speed.  The technicals ar fine and you did a great job on the exposure.  Overall 6 as I do like the photo.</td>', 'I think the centered composition doesn''t do so well here.  With the dog comeing straight to the camera I''m not getting much sense of speed.  The technicals ar fine and you did a great job on the exposure.  Overall 6 as I do like the photo.', '2007-08-31 15:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044218, 578672, 68256, '<td valign="top">Are you whopping that processor with a mallet?  I don''t get it...A speedy trial?  I would understand speedy processor, but I just don''t get the mallet!  Anyway, it is a fine photo and I like the composition. 7</td>', 'Are you whopping that processor with a mallet?  I don''t get it...A speedy trial?  I would understand speedy processor, but I just don''t get the mallet!  Anyway, it is a fine photo and I like the composition. 7', '2007-08-31 15:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044222, 578418, 68256, '<td valign="top">Now that is some speed!  However the illusion was done, you have "hit the nail on the head".  9</td>', 'Now that is some speed!  However the illusion was done, you have "hit the nail on the head".  9', '2007-08-31 15:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044225, 577303, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I love the since of motion and the diagonals.  I can''t think of anything that would have made it better so ..... 10.</td>', 'Very nice!  I love the since of motion and the diagonals.  I can''t think of anything that would have made it better so ..... 10.', '2007-08-31 15:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044227, 578022, 68256, '<td valign="top">I really don''t know why I like this so much...The composition is nice and actually the lighting is very good...It just all comes together for me! 9</td>', 'I really don''t know why I like this so much...The composition is nice and actually the lighting is very good...It just all comes together for me! 9', '2007-08-31 15:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
