(4044241, 577847, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great since of motion! It is a shame the rest of the biker wasn''t as "sharp" as the back tire, but I''m not subtracting from my vote because it doesn''t really effect my overall perception....Well maybe it is the difference between a perfect 10 and 9....:)</td>', 'Great since of motion! It is a shame the rest of the biker wasn''t as "sharp" as the back tire, but I''m not subtracting from my vote because it doesn''t really effect my overall perception....Well maybe it is the difference between a perfect 10 and 9....:)', '2007-08-31 16:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044243, 578380, 68256, '<td valign="top">The selective desat on this is just so weird an so intrigueing....99.9999% of the time this would have failed miserably, but I really like it.  It is the beard that really makes it pop :)  As far as speed goes, it isn''t a stretch to interpret this as the speed of the human brain....9</td>', 'The selective desat on this is just so weird an so intrigueing....99.9999% of the time this would have failed miserably, but I really like it.  It is the beard that really makes it pop :)  As far as speed goes, it isn''t a stretch to interpret this as the speed of the human brain....9', '2007-08-31 16:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044251, 576825, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great composition and timing!  I know it must have been hard not to clone out the blue hat and green grass, but I hope people don''t count off for that.  The one thing I don''t get is the title because the runner is obviously beating the throw. 8</td>', 'Great composition and timing!  I know it must have been hard not to clone out the blue hat and green grass, but I hope people don''t count off for that.  The one thing I don''t get is the title because the runner is obviously beating the throw. 8', '2007-08-31 16:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044278, 576124, 68256, '<td valign="top">I really love this capture of speed...The centered compostion absolutely works wonderully and the since of speed is so great even with frozen motion of a fast shutter speed.  I don''t know yet if it is my favorite of the challenge as I haven''t gone through all of them, but it certainly is up there!</td>', 'I really love this capture of speed...The centered compostion absolutely works wonderully and the since of speed is so great even with frozen motion of a fast shutter speed.  I don''t know yet if it is my favorite of the challenge as I haven''t gone through all of them, but it certainly is up there!', '2007-08-31 16:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
