(4053732, 578418, 82442, '<td valign="top">the movment is nice.  i like how the photo doesn''t show any evidence of anyone taking the picture (no reflection in the mirror, no legs in the seat)  very interesting...</td>', 'the movment is nice.  i like how the photo doesn''t show any evidence of anyone taking the picture (no reflection in the mirror, no legs in the seat)  very interesting...', '2007-09-03 16:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053734, 578644, 82442, '<td valign="top">i appreciate what you are doing with this subject.  however, i would suggest that if you are trying to capture the movement of the water droplets, [in my opinion] you need to make sure they are in focus... the only thing that i mainly criticize with this piece is the fact that there really isn''t anything to focus on.  i mean, the water droplets are interesting, but i''m not sure if the texture of the stone is more interesting... i don''t know... maybe make a more deliberate approach to what you''re trying to show in this type of photo.</td>', 'i appreciate what you are doing with this subject.  however, i would suggest that if you are trying to capture the movement of the water droplets, [in my opinion] you need to make sure they are in focus... the only thing that i mainly criticize with this piece is the fact that there really isn''t anything to focus on.  i mean, the water droplets are interesting, but i''m not sure if the texture of the stone is more interesting... i don''t know... maybe make a more deliberate approach to what you''re trying to show in this type of photo.', '2007-09-03 16:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053736, 577684, 82442, '<td valign="top">there is alot of movement, yes... but there isn''t really any attention to detail or composition.  doesn''t "wow" me...</td>', 'there is alot of movement, yes... but there isn''t really any attention to detail or composition.  doesn''t "wow" me...', '2007-09-03 16:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053741, 575991, 82442, '<td valign="top">movement, yes.  but a picture of a cool car going fast has been done about 12891273897398 times before.... basically what i''m trying to say is if you''re going to do a picture of a cool car... photograph it in a cool way to make your picture unique from the tons of car pics floatin out there...</td>', 'movement, yes.  but a picture of a cool car going fast has been done about 12891273897398 times before.... basically what i''m trying to say is if you''re going to do a picture of a cool car... photograph it in a cool way to make your picture unique from the tons of car pics floatin out there...', '2007-09-03 16:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053743, 577711, 82442, '<td valign="top">don''t use a flash when you''re using a macro lens.  at least not of a shiny/slimy thing...  make sure the focal plan is on the most important part of the subject... in this case, was is the lower back of the slug?  try getting on your belly and shooting right next to the slug to get a more "intimate" view of it.  we all see slugs by looking down at them.  try finding a new, more interesting angle that might give your picture a little more "ooomff!"</td>', 'don''t use a flash when you''re using a macro lens.  at least not of a shiny/slimy thing...  make sure the focal plan is on the most important part of the subject... in this case, was is the lower back of the slug?  try getting on your belly and shooting right next to the slug to get a more "intimate" view of it.  we all see slugs by looking down at them.  try finding a new, more interesting angle that might give your picture a little more "ooomff!"', '2007-09-03 16:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053744, 576833, 82442, '<td valign="top">i love the clarity.  the color is nice.  contrast looks good to me. i would''ve taken out the red cooler; that''s a little distracting.  not bad though!</td>', 'i love the clarity.  the color is nice.  contrast looks good to me. i would''ve taken out the red cooler; that''s a little distracting.  not bad though!', '2007-09-03 16:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053749, 578283, 82442, '<td valign="top">color is exquisite(sp).  work on composition a little more...  try working in "thirds"...</td>', 'color is exquisite(sp).  work on composition a little more...  try working in "thirds"...', '2007-09-03 16:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053752, 578547, 82442, '<td valign="top">if you''re going to use a "zoom" filter in photoshop, make sure that the viewer doesn''t pick up on it.  that''s the first thing i thought of when i saw this pic.  if you didn''t use the zoom filter and/or you''re not familiar with it... check it out... cause it looks just like this.</td>', 'if you''re going to use a "zoom" filter in photoshop, make sure that the viewer doesn''t pick up on it.  that''s the first thing i thought of when i saw this pic.  if you didn''t use the zoom filter and/or you''re not familiar with it... check it out... cause it looks just like this.', '2007-09-03 16:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053755, 578628, 82442, '<td valign="top">i like the concept, but there needs to be a purpose for taking this pic... this looks like a shot from a disposable that you accidentally hit the button and didn''t know it was on the roll when you picked it up from the one hour photo lab.  i would suggest doing this shot again, but put a little more planning into it.</td>', 'i like the concept, but there needs to be a purpose for taking this pic... this looks like a shot from a disposable that you accidentally hit the button and didn''t know it was on the roll when you picked it up from the one hour photo lab.  i would suggest doing this shot again, but put a little more planning into it.', '2007-09-03 16:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053758, 578589, 82442, '<td valign="top">not bad.  i would have used a slightly slower shutter speed to make the guy a little less blurry...</td>', 'not bad.  i would have used a slightly slower shutter speed to make the guy a little less blurry...', '2007-09-03 16:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053760, 578440, 82442, '<td valign="top">hmmm....</td>', 'hmmm....', '2007-09-03 16:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053765, 575849, 82442, '<td valign="top">i love it. i personally am a fan of long-term exposures using flashlights/cell phones/etc.  i think there is a nice central focus.  good color.  lovely linework.  good job!</td>', 'i love it. i personally am a fan of long-term exposures using flashlights/cell phones/etc.  i think there is a nice central focus.  good color.  lovely linework.  good job!', '2007-09-03 16:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053767, 578472, 82442, '<td valign="top">wonderful. be careful with your cropping.  i like how it''s arbitrarily cropped, but it can get you into trouble if you don''t use that style appropriately...</td>', 'wonderful. be careful with your cropping.  i like how it''s arbitrarily cropped, but it can get you into trouble if you don''t use that style appropriately...', '2007-09-03 16:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053768, 576904, 82442, '<td valign="top">average...</td>', 'average...', '2007-09-03 16:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053770, 577542, 82442, '<td valign="top">there is no speed in the picture... figuratively or physically.... why was this submitted?</td>', 'there is no speed in the picture... figuratively or physically.... why was this submitted?', '2007-09-03 16:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053772, 578259, 82442, '<td valign="top">i like the composition.  i would like to see more contrast for the dog... i like the red object, but i don''t know what it is... maybe you could recreate this scene, but use an object that''s more recognizable... just a thought.</td>', 'i like the composition.  i would like to see more contrast for the dog... i like the red object, but i don''t know what it is... maybe you could recreate this scene, but use an object that''s more recognizable... just a thought.', '2007-09-03 16:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053774, 578350, 82442, '<td valign="top">nice composition and lighting... the 101 is distracting to me...  it already looks like you''re going fast, we don''t need to see that physical speed...</td>', 'nice composition and lighting... the 101 is distracting to me...  it already looks like you''re going fast, we don''t need to see that physical speed...', '2007-09-03 16:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053775, 576946, 82442, '<td valign="top">it''s been done before... way too many times in fact...</td>', 'it''s been done before... way too many times in fact...', '2007-09-03 16:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053778, 576032, 82442, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition.  be careful not to over-dodge the eyes though.. you don''t want them to look like they''re lit-up themselves!  awesome color!<br/> <br/>great job</td>', 'wonderful composition.  be careful not to over-dodge the eyes though.. you don''t want them to look like they''re lit-up themselves!  awesome color! great job', '2007-09-03 16:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053779, 578078, 82442, '<td valign="top">i''m not trying to be rude, but i keep asking myself, "what''s the point of this picture?"</td>', 'i''m not trying to be rude, but i keep asking myself, "what''s the point of this picture?"', '2007-09-03 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053782, 577522, 82442, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL!  finally a good one!  the only constructive criticism that i would throw at you is to watch the contrast... i would make it slightly sharper just to make the girls pop a little more.  great job!</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL!  finally a good one!  the only constructive criticism that i would throw at you is to watch the contrast... i would make it slightly sharper just to make the girls pop a little more.  great job!', '2007-09-03 16:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053783, 577399, 82442, '<td valign="top">this photo has potential.  try this again from a really high perspective....and maybe a wide-angle lens....</td>', 'this photo has potential.  try this again from a really high perspective....and maybe a wide-angle lens....', '2007-09-03 16:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053784, 578257, 82442, '<td valign="top">cool!  any reason why you made it b&amp;w?</td>', 'cool!  any reason why you made it b&w?', '2007-09-03 16:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4053790, 578386, 82442, '<td valign="top">i find the colors in the background more interesting than the subject... i''m guessing that wasn''t the goal... remember everything plays a part in the photo... even the smallest detail can cause the whole picture to change.</td>', 'i find the colors in the background more interesting than the subject... i''m guessing that wasn''t the goal... remember everything plays a part in the photo... even the smallest detail can cause the whole picture to change.', '2007-09-03 16:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
