(4056647, 577939, 68947, '<td valign="top">"Whew, what a ride!  I''m sure glad that I put in that extra hair gel this morning!" the one boy said, checking to make sure that his hairdo was still intact.  <br/> <br/>"Ah, you''re nuts!" said the other boy, watching his cart mate fussing with his hair.  "Who''s gonna see ya anyways?  You shoulda got the buzz cut that my mom made me get and you wouldn''t have to worry about it."<br/> <br/>When the 2 boys got off the ride, one went directly to the bathroom to fix his ailing hair and place more gel into it, while the other, with his carefree do, headed for some candy floss.  <br/> <br/>Both boys walked through the fair for the rest of the night......one with hair as hard as a football helmet and the other........well, he just flashed his big ole smile......blue teeth, tongue, lips and all from his candy floss.</td>', '"Whew, what a ride!  I''m sure glad that I put in that extra hair gel this morning!" the one boy said, checking to make sure that his hairdo was still intact.   "Ah, you''re nuts!" said the other boy, watching his cart mate fussing with his hair.  "Who''s gonna see ya anyways?  You shoulda got the buzz cut that my mom made me get and you wouldn''t have to worry about it." When the 2 boys got off the ride, one went directly to the bathroom to fix his ailing hair and place more gel into it, while the other, with his carefree do, headed for some candy floss.   Both boys walked through the fair for the rest of the night......one with hair as hard as a football helmet and the other........well, he just flashed his big ole smile......blue teeth, tongue, lips and all from his candy floss.', '2007-09-04 13:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
