(4057449, 578564, 68586, '<td valign="top">A different take on a speed. <br/> <br/>I like the bold simplicity of the shot with the red against a white background, and I like the positioning of the mixer so that you can see both the movement of the whisk, and the speed control.</td>', 'A different take on a speed.  I like the bold simplicity of the shot with the red against a white background, and I like the positioning of the mixer so that you can see both the movement of the whisk, and the speed control.', '2007-09-04 17:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4057475, 577714, 68586, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird.<br/> <br/>My only question is whether this actually conveys speed ? With the wings largely staionary and no reference points in the background it shows a great shot of a hummingbird, but speed . . or does it show hovering? and is hovering speed or lack of it? Not sure.<br/> <br/>That said it is only my opinion and it is certainly a lovely shot.</td>', 'Beautiful bird. My only question is whether this actually conveys speed ? With the wings largely staionary and no reference points in the background it shows a great shot of a hummingbird, but speed . . or does it show hovering? and is hovering speed or lack of it? Not sure. That said it is only my opinion and it is certainly a lovely shot.', '2007-09-04 17:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4057476, 577298, 68586, '<td valign="top">strong image - almost a little dark - I think it is the starkness of the picture at the top of the stairs.</td>', 'strong image - almost a little dark - I think it is the starkness of the picture at the top of the stairs.', '2007-09-04 17:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4057477, 576489, 68586, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept behind this one, and I love the bright colours of the caterpillers against the black backdrop. The only slight question in my mind is whether the spring looks too bright ?</td>', 'I really like the concept behind this one, and I love the bright colours of the caterpillers against the black backdrop. The only slight question in my mind is whether the spring looks too bright ?', '2007-09-04 17:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4057478, 576093, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I like the tension in it</td>', 'Nice shot - I like the tension in it', '2007-09-04 17:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4057481, 578555, 68586, '<td valign="top">This must be one of Angela''s shots surely . . This has to be the same piece of road used for PaPa''s Horse . . they say the first sign of fame is when your work get''s recognised  ;   )<br/> <br/>lol.</td>', 'This must be one of Angela''s shots surely . . This has to be the same piece of road used for PaPa''s Horse . . they say the first sign of fame is when your work get''s recognised  ;   ) lol.', '2007-09-04 17:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4057483, 577067, 68586, '<td valign="top">very powerful post processing work - good effect</td>', 'very powerful post processing work - good effect', '2007-09-04 17:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4057485, 577054, 68586, '<td valign="top">What an incredible stunt (and I''m not using rhyming slang here  :  )  )<br/> <br/>Good capture, nice cropping, and background blur.<br/> <br/>The only question I have is (to me ) does this ultimately represent speed, or an amazing stunt?</td>', 'What an incredible stunt (and I''m not using rhyming slang here  :  )  ) Good capture, nice cropping, and background blur. The only question I have is (to me ) does this ultimately represent speed, or an amazing stunt?', '2007-09-04 17:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4057487, 578446, 68586, '<td valign="top">Good crop - it really adds to the feeling of speed.</td>', 'Good crop - it really adds to the feeling of speed.', '2007-09-04 17:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4057488, 578307, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice planes, good capture, but I''m (personally) not sure about the crop . . <br/> <br/>If the middle plane had been leading the others into the picture it would have been stronger, or even if it had been on it''s own, as it is it almost looks like you have just caught them as they are disappearing.<br/> <br/> This however is only my opinion, and many others may disagree  :-  )</td>', 'Nice planes, good capture, but I''m (personally) not sure about the crop . .  If the middle plane had been leading the others into the picture it would have been stronger, or even if it had been on it''s own, as it is it almost looks like you have just caught them as they are disappearing.  This however is only my opinion, and many others may disagree  :-  )', '2007-09-04 17:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4057490, 576576, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice doggie . .<br/> <br/>Lovely capture of him (her) at full stretch, definately benefits from the B&amp;W treatment.</td>', 'Nice doggie . . Lovely capture of him (her) at full stretch, definately benefits from the B&W treatment.', '2007-09-04 17:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
