(4060449, 577363, 81664, '<td valign="top">I have received a couple of comments about my husbands lack of safety gear, and I wanted to state that normally he is quite safe when he is riding.<br/> <br/>We were in our backyard, and he kept zooming past me at about 2 or 3 mph. I am sorry that it looked like we were trying to promote unsafe riding. It was not my intention.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the constructive comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-05 08:43:53.</i></td>', 'I have received a couple of comments about my husbands lack of safety gear, and I wanted to state that normally he is quite safe when he is riding. We were in our backyard, and he kept zooming past me at about 2 or 3 mph. I am sorry that it looked like we were trying to promote unsafe riding. It was not my intention. Thanks for all the constructive comments.', '2007-09-05 09:25:52.000000', '2007-09-05 09:43:53.000000', 0),
