(4060689, 578275, 45919, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.<br/> <br/>I knew I would lose votes because of my broad interpretation of the theme, but felt the need to share the photo, I''m actually really happy with 102nd because of that, about mid-range which is good, especially considering I could only take the photo in a 15 minute window and only a few hours before the challenge closed.<br/> <br/>Comments really helpful and glad you liked it.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. I knew I would lose votes because of my broad interpretation of the theme, but felt the need to share the photo, I''m actually really happy with 102nd because of that, about mid-range which is good, especially considering I could only take the photo in a 15 minute window and only a few hours before the challenge closed. Comments really helpful and glad you liked it.', '2007-09-05 10:25:14.000000', NULL, 0),
