(4060826, 578446, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m glad this photo made the top fifty, but I expected it to make the top ten (fyi, I was one of your "10" voters).  So many elements suggest speed.  I like the tilt of the land and how the man''s blurred feet contrast with the clarity in his arm and torso.  The blurred birds are interesting, too.</td>', 'I''m glad this photo made the top fifty, but I expected it to make the top ten (fyi, I was one of your "10" voters).  So many elements suggest speed.  I like the tilt of the land and how the man''s blurred feet contrast with the clarity in his arm and torso.  The blurred birds are interesting, too.', '2007-09-05 10:48:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4060875, 578441, 80912, '<td valign="top">Just to answer the "no composition" comment. Yes, it was accidental, but I did several of these, and chose the shot that had the best composition. Not only did it look most like an actual tree (the others were even more abstract), but it had the best range of colors, and the tree branches obey the rule of 3rds. (Which is the main reason for not cropping)</td>', 'Just to answer the "no composition" comment. Yes, it was accidental, but I did several of these, and chose the shot that had the best composition. Not only did it look most like an actual tree (the others were even more abstract), but it had the best range of colors, and the tree branches obey the rule of 3rds. (Which is the main reason for not cropping)', '2007-09-05 10:53:44.000000', NULL, 0),
