(4061246, 578489, 62318, '<td valign="top">I really like the feeling of speed on this one. The composition is very nice. Only suggestion maybe a different time of day. it might be nice as a  night shot? still, like the setup.</td>', 'I really like the feeling of speed on this one. The composition is very nice. Only suggestion maybe a different time of day. it might be nice as a  night shot? still, like the setup.', '2007-09-05 12:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4061260, 577319, 32334, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pekesty:</b></div><hr/><i> Very trippy looking pan...makes for a very cool effect.  I''m still trying to figure out the motion of both you and the rider for this look. Great color and contrast.  Super cool photo! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The effect was caused by using a really wide angle lens (a 10mm on a d70) and being close to the rider.</td>', 'Originally posted by pekesty: Very trippy looking pan...makes for a very cool effect.  I''m still trying to figure out the motion of both you and the rider for this look. Great color and contrast.  Super cool photo!   The effect was caused by using a really wide angle lens (a 10mm on a d70) and being close to the rider.', '2007-09-05 12:18:05.000000', NULL, 0),
