(4061615, 577939, 62318, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it helps your equilibrium when you are taking shots during the ride. :) wonderful shot. Nice movement and considering the difficulty, I think you managed to pull  off a well composed shot.</td>', 'I don''t think it helps your equilibrium when you are taking shots during the ride. :) wonderful shot. Nice movement and considering the difficulty, I think you managed to pull  off a well composed shot.', '2007-09-05 13:47:04.000000', NULL, 0),
