(4061622, 576896, 62318, '<td valign="top">nice perspective. might have liked the buildings either in fully silhouette or more detail. Just a minor quibble to an excellent photo. The peaking sun and the jet trail really make this shot.</td>', 'nice perspective. might have liked the buildings either in fully silhouette or more detail. Just a minor quibble to an excellent photo. The peaking sun and the jet trail really make this shot.', '2007-09-05 13:49:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4061649, 576825, 66597, '<td valign="top">Ah Jeffrey, so close to that 6! I think you did a great job of processing this. Were it advanced, and  you could have cloned out the head, you would have scored much higher.</td>', 'Ah Jeffrey, so close to that 6! I think you did a great job of processing this. Were it advanced, and  you could have cloned out the head, you would have scored much higher.', '2007-09-05 13:59:17.000000', NULL, 0),
