(4061654, 578662, 66597, '<td valign="top">Colleen, I didn''t get to this photo while voting, but I think you got robbed. There''s a great sense of motion and speed here, and the colors are most interesting. You would have had a 7 or 8 from me. Sorry I missed it!</td>', 'Colleen, I didn''t get to this photo while voting, but I think you got robbed. There''s a great sense of motion and speed here, and the colors are most interesting. You would have had a 7 or 8 from me. Sorry I missed it!', '2007-09-05 14:01:31.000000', NULL, 0),
