(4063166, 577867, 77196, '<td valign="top">For those who voted down on this because they thought it DNMC:<br/> <br/>The challenge was to convey speed (fast or slow), not to show something speeding.<br/> <br/>If Porsche, one of the fastest production automobiles in the world for over 40 years doesn''t convey speed...<br/> <br/>BTW - Word of advice. If you like to drive, don''t drive a Porsche unless you can afford to buy one. Especially not on a twisting, windy road. <br/> <br/>And in case you''re wondering, no, I don''t own one (although I''d like to...)<br/></td>', 'For those who voted down on this because they thought it DNMC: The challenge was to convey speed (fast or slow), not to show something speeding. If Porsche, one of the fastest production automobiles in the world for over 40 years doesn''t convey speed... BTW - Word of advice. If you like to drive, don''t drive a Porsche unless you can afford to buy one. Especially not on a twisting, windy road.  And in case you''re wondering, no, I don''t own one (although I''d like to...)', '2007-09-05 21:30:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4063175, 578293, 40973, '<td valign="top">It makes me feel like I''m standing on the beach watching the incoming rain and boat. Great minimalist approach.</td>', 'It makes me feel like I''m standing on the beach watching the incoming rain and boat. Great minimalist approach.', '2007-09-05 21:33:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4063185, 578638, 37930, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried it before and never succeeded... Blur was my problem, too. Not only hard to keep a kid really still but also hard to hold the camera steady on a spinning playground toy. That one must be a superbly balanced and well oiled one.. or you''re just better at it than I am. Very well done and congrats on your well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'I''ve tried it before and never succeeded... Blur was my problem, too. Not only hard to keep a kid really still but also hard to hold the camera steady on a spinning playground toy. That one must be a superbly balanced and well oiled one.. or you''re just better at it than I am. Very well done and congrats on your well deserved ribbon.', '2007-09-05 21:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4063194, 578561, 37930, '<td valign="top">Great stop motion shot. Nicely framed too... did you crop it or was it shot like that? Just curious. Congrats on your ribbon =]</td>', 'Great stop motion shot. Nicely framed too... did you crop it or was it shot like that? Just curious. Congrats on your ribbon =]', '2007-09-05 21:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4063202, 577714, 37930, '<td valign="top">Very nice hummingbird shot. The birds head is a bit blown out but it isn''t that harmful. It''s still better than I could do. Congrats on your new ribbon =]</td>', 'Very nice hummingbird shot. The birds head is a bit blown out but it isn''t that harmful. It''s still better than I could do. Congrats on your new ribbon =]', '2007-09-05 21:38:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4063234, 577067, 37930, '<td valign="top">Was it really necessary for him to go 90k/h that close to you? The shot would have looked the same at 30. Regardless, very nice capture, the sky is beautiful. And congrats on a top 5 finish you crazy woman. =]</td>', 'Was it really necessary for him to go 90k/h that close to you? The shot would have looked the same at 30. Regardless, very nice capture, the sky is beautiful. And congrats on a top 5 finish you crazy woman. =]', '2007-09-05 21:54:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4063241, 576489, 37930, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool shot. Deserving of hanging on someone''s wall (someone with good taste, at that!). Congrats on the top 10 finish.</td>', 'This is such a cool shot. Deserving of hanging on someone''s wall (someone with good taste, at that!). Congrats on the top 10 finish.', '2007-09-05 21:56:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4063386, 578638, 81081, '<td valign="top">well done. I like the idea and how you managed to take the picture. Good job.</td>', 'well done. I like the idea and how you managed to take the picture. Good job.', '2007-09-05 22:38:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4063546, 577067, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Atropos:</b></div><hr/><i> Was it really necessary for him to go 90k/h that close to you? The shot would have looked the same at 30. Regardless, very nice capture, the sky is beautiful. And congrats on a top 5 finish you crazy woman. =] </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was initially aiming for him to have a lean on the bike, hence the tight corner....we were actually closer to the corner then what it appears because of the fish eye.  But, because of the fish eye, the lean wasn''t as strong as I liked.  That is why I needed him to have the speed more than the placement in the photo.</td>', 'Originally posted by Atropos: Was it really necessary for him to go 90k/h that close to you? The shot would have looked the same at 30. Regardless, very nice capture, the sky is beautiful. And congrats on a top 5 finish you crazy woman. =]   I was initially aiming for him to have a lean on the bike, hence the tight corner....we were actually closer to the corner then what it appears because of the fish eye.  But, because of the fish eye, the lean wasn''t as strong as I liked.  That is why I needed him to have the speed more than the placement in the photo.', '2007-09-05 23:32:26.000000', NULL, 0),
