(4079193, 578275, 26194, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club:<br/> <br/>Critique by psart:<br/> <br/>Composition:<br/>This is a well composed shot. Positioning of the moon is great. Close to rule of thirds which brings viewers eye back to subject over and over. Image is framed well, using distances between subjects as I would of done. <br/>Focus:<br/>Focus is superb. Nothing to suggest here. Well done.<br/>Lighting:<br/>One of the strong points of this image, image detail is vivid no dark or burnt out details. Good job.<br/>Overall:<br/>A great image and title, about as good as can be expected for this subject matter. Looking forward to seeing more of your submissions. <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the critique club: Critique by psart: Composition:This is a well composed shot. Positioning of the moon is great. Close to rule of thirds which brings viewers eye back to subject over and over. Image is framed well, using distances between subjects as I would of done. Focus:Focus is superb. Nothing to suggest here. Well done.Lighting:One of the strong points of this image, image detail is vivid no dark or burnt out details. Good job.Overall:A great image and title, about as good as can be expected for this subject matter. Looking forward to seeing more of your submissions. ', '2007-09-10 20:28:35.000000', NULL, 0),
