(4082666, 577522, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is such a perfect capture of summer fun.  Congrats on top 5 and your new personal best score!  I''m with you about having your kids on your top row.  One of my daughters was there for several months, but got bumped.  I just have to keep trying. :)</td>', 'This is such a perfect capture of summer fun.  Congrats on top 5 and your new personal best score!  I''m with you about having your kids on your top row.  One of my daughters was there for several months, but got bumped.  I just have to keep trying. :)', '2007-09-11 23:53:41.000000', NULL, 0),
